	(text "There is no resistor-set threshold, timer or latch on this sheet. The aggregate\nchanges after two logic stages when a status changes. Schmitt inputs accept\nslower status transitions. The unused U3018 gate has its inputs tied to GND and\nits output left unconnected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 114.02 0)
